{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106169","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106169/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106169/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106169/events","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106169","id":3048617354,"node_id":"I_kwDOAO6SJc61tjWK","number":106169,"title":"c++ engine module. Engine will not call lifecicle functions of node implemented in a module.","user":{"login":"RonYanDaik","id":3350340,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMzNTAzNDA=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3350340?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/RonYanDaik","html_url":"https://github.com/RonYanDaik","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RonYanDaik/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RonYanDaik/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RonYanDaik/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RonYanDaik/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RonYanDaik/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RonYanDaik/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RonYanDaik/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RonYanDaik/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/RonYanDaik/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-05-08T10:52:27Z","updated_at":"2025-05-08T10:59:13Z","closed_at":"2025-05-08T10:58:28Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- v: 4.4.x\n\n### System information\n\ndoenst matter\n\n### Issue description\n\nThe documentation says and i quote: \n\n> \n> Adding C++ modules can be useful in the following scenarios:\n>     Write a whole, new game in C++ because you can't live without C++.\n> \n\nSo I tied because o cant live without c++ and i want to save several calls of functions that happen between extension c++ and engine. \n\nBut it turns out that engine wont call Node lifecycle functions.\n\nso a class like this:\n\n```\nclass GameTestNode : public Node{\n    GDCLASS(GameTestNode , Node)\n    public:\n    void _bind_functions(){}\n\n    void _ready();\n\n    void _exit_tree();\n};\n```\nwill not receive calls of `_exit_tree` and `_ready` and etc.\n\nI assume you need something else like `static void register_virtuals()` but documentation does not say anything about that ofc.\n\nSo I decided to report it here since I've seen some people trying to do the same.\n\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nN/A\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nN/A","closed_by":{"login":"akien-mga","id":4701338,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3MDEzMzg=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4701338?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga","html_url":"https://github.com/akien-mga","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/subscriptions","organizations_url":"h